# Clarity: Clarity language reference (docs.stacks.co); requirements/languages/clarity.md
name     clarity clar
keyword  define-public define-private define-read-only define-constant define-data-var define-map
keyword  define-fungible-token define-non-fungible-token let begin if match asserts! unwrap! try!
type     uint int bool principal buff string-ascii string-utf8 list tuple response optional
builtin  true false none some ok err tx-sender block-height var-get var-set map-get? map-set
ident-extra    !?*<>=/+-
ident-part     !?*<>=/+-
line-comment   ;;
string   " "  : escapes
prefix   u
call-after-paren
